 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/f522c622d099574492761c46d6af4944.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >무작위로 생성된 포스트아포칼립스 세계를 발견하세요. 새 게임마다 다른 출발점과 경험이 제공되어 버려진 장소와 도로에서 자원을 수집하고 생존할 수 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/d4f0d307821c1339f8b6d8d5c06d26f5.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >낡은 RV로 여정을 시작하여 각 부분을 수리하고 업그레이드하세요. 스토브와 냉장고부터 화장실과 좌석 공간에 이르기까지 모든 것을 개인화하여 자신만의 생활 공간을 만드세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/bb3ffa9b560299c78f3197bbe1f43f11.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >요리, 낚시, 수리, 커피 만들기 등의 활동으로 생존하세요. 찾은 음식을 요리하기 위해 RV의 주방을 사용하여 더 든든한 식사를 만드세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/16046b361eda934e81b960f4443011f7.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >모든 부분이 완전히 상호 작용 가능한 Nomad Drive를 발견하세요. 가구부터 가전 제품에 이르기까지 모든 것을 만지고, 맞춤 설정하고, 탐험하세요. RV를 진짜 나만의 공간으로 만들어보세요!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/87080780a6a32816c46199043bf2f963.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad Drive 세계에서 발견한 과일과 채소의 씨앗을 화분에 심고 돌보며 길러보세요. 맛있는 과일과 채소로 보답할 것입니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/53425fe97f754887d53e7942d7d97a6d.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/f522c622d099574492761c46d6af4944.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >무작위로 생성된 포스트아포칼립스 세계를 발견하세요. 새 게임마다 다른 출발점과 경험이 제공되어 버려진 장소와 도로에서 자원을 수집하고 생존할 수 있습니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/d4f0d307821c1339f8b6d8d5c06d26f5.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >낡은 RV로 여정을 시작하여 각 부분을 수리하고 업그레이드하세요. 스토브와 냉장고부터 화장실과 좌석 공간에 이르기까지 모든 것을 개인화하여 자신만의 생활 공간을 만드세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/